      "description": "Generalization gap reduction: Delta_rho_A1 < Delta_rho_A0 while preserving in-domain selection quality (regression protection).",
      "type": "decision_matrix",
      "primary_metric": "delta_rho = rho_in_domain - rho_zero_shot",
